%I A401496 #9 Nov 04 2026 15:05:12
%S A401496 1,2,4,12,28,92,220,732,1756,5852,14044,46812,112348,374492
%N A401496 Number of labeled Riordan graphs of order n whose complement, with the same vertex labeling, is also a labeled Riordan graph.
%C A401496 Labeled Riordan graphs are defined in A401493. There are A047849(n-1) of them on n vertices.
%H A401496 Gi-Sang Cheon, Ji-Hwan Jung, Sergey Kitaev and Seyed Ahmad Mojallal, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.laa.2019.05.033">Riordan graphs I: Structural properties</a>, Linear Algebra Appl. 579 (2019), 89-135.
%H A401496 Arnauld Mesinga Mwafise, <a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23676628">riordan-graph-enumerator</a>, C++ software for enumerating, listing and sampling Riordan graphs, Zenodo, 2026.
%F A401496 Conjecture: a(n) = 8*a(n-2) - 4 for n >= 3.
%F A401496 Conjecture: a(n+1) - a(n) = 2^floor(3*(n-1)/2), so a(n) = 1 + Sum_{k=1..n-1} 2^floor(3*(k-1)/2).
%F A401496 Conjecture: a(n) = A113836(n-1) + 1.
%F A401496 Conjecture: a(2*k) = (108^(k-1) + 4)/7 and a(2*k+1) = (38^k + 4)/7.
%F A401496 Conjecture: G.f.: x*(1 - 2*x)*(1 + 3*x)/((1 - x)*(1 - 8*x^2)).
%Y A401496 Cf. A047849, A113836, A401493, A401495.
%K A401496 nonn,more,new
%O A401496 1,2
%A A401496 _Arnauld Mesinga Mwafise_, Oct 27 2026
